msgstr "Alapértelmezett fizetési opció"

#: includes/class-wc-deposits-settings.php:151
msgid ""
"The payment method which appears pre-selected at the product page, when "
"paying using deposits is marked as optional."
msgstr "Az a fizetési mód, amely előre kiválasztva jelenik meg a termékoldalon, amikor az előlegfizetés opcionálisként van beállítva."

#: includes/class-wc-deposits-settings.php:153
#: includes/views/html-deposit-data.php:80
msgid ""
"Controls the default payment selection that appears pre-selected at the "
"product page, when paying using deposits is marked as <b>Optional</b>. This "
"option is ignored if the deposit requirement is set to <b>Required</b>."
